### 일정 생성
POST localhost:8080/authors/1/schedules
content-type: application/json

{
  "title":"title1",
  "contents": "contents1"
}

### 일정 전체 조회
GET localhost:8080/authors/1/schedules

### 일정 상세 조회
GET localhost:8080/authors/1/schedules/1

### 일정 수정
PUT localhost:8080/authors/1/schedules/1
content-type: application/json

{
    "title": "updated_title",
    "contents": "updated_contents"
}

### 일정 삭제
DELETE localhost:8080/authors/1/schedules/1

### 댓글 생성
POST localhost:8080/comments?authorId=1&scheduleId=1&commentUserId=1
content-type: application/json

{
    "contents": "comment_content"
}

### 댓글 조회
GET localhost:8080/comments?scheduleId=1&commentUserId=1&commentId=1

### 댓글 수정
PUT localhost:8080/comments?scheduleId=1&commentUserId=1&commentId=1
content-type: application/json

{
    "contents": "updated_comment_content"
}

### 댓글 삭제
DELETE localhost:8080/comments?scheduleId=1&commentUserId=1&commentId=1






